    "updated_at": "2024-05-11T11:08:39Z",
    "body": "I've recently come across the limitations with this cross-root popover API, it would be very nice if you could use the IDL to assign elements truly cross root. e.g. button in light dom, popover in shadow or button in shadow, popover in shadow.\r\n\r\nIf you have the element reference you already have full access to the shadow tree so I don't think this would expose anything you don't already have?",
